# Generated stacks, deploy records and local configs: real RPC keys, validator
# and keeper private keys, Solana keypairs. `COPY . .` in the builder stage
# would bake any of them into an image layer (audit round 4, LOW).
docker/*/configs
docker/*/.env
docker/*/keys
docker/production/*/.env
docker/production/*/configs
docker/production/*/secrets
.solana
scripts/*.config.local
scripts/run.config.local
config/*.local.json
config/deployments
sig-store-data*
# root-level TOMLs are the ad-hoc service configs the test suites write (they
# carry private_key); `*` does not cross `/`, so crate manifests are untouched.
*.toml
!Cargo.toml
frontend/.env.local
.env
